{"title":"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Casey's shop class is making a golf trophy. He has to paint 300 dimples on a golf ball. If it takes him 2 seconds to paint one dimple, how many minutes will it take for him to finish \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/7/2970bb6d983fc58ac7adef097dd8fbd31c6cbf21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ 4 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ 6 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ 8 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ 10 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ 12 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"363\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It will take him <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b6205fe79361dea37f66fe1f5880dd9e74c0277b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300\\cdot2=600$\" width=\"100\" height=\"12\" /> seconds to paint all the dimples. \n</p><p>This is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/c/becbe9a0f54974e06d1d93835362e88c38aeb3a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{600}{60}=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"73\" height=\"37\" /> minutes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d10470541aa34ca0aa4528d834090c1bd38c015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow \\boxed{D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"50\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8\" title=\"2001 AMC 8\">2001 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2001\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First<br />Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2001 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</